WEBVTT

00:00:58.454 --> 00:01:02.037
J.J. kindly agreed to turn the microphone
around and host me for

00:01:02.037 --> 00:01:07.496
a chat about my new book, Think Again The
Power of Knowing What You Don't Know.

00:01:08.454 --> 00:01:11.288
It's a book about the science
of rethinking our opinions,

00:01:11.579 --> 00:01:14.579
opening other people's minds and
creating cultures of learning.

00:01:15.288 --> 00:01:19.246
It officially launches February 2nd, but
I wanted to give you a sneak preview.

00:01:19.621 --> 00:01:23.413
So I sent JJ an early copy and told him
he was in charge of our interview.

00:01:24.621 --> 00:01:26.829
Thanks to Viking Penguin, my publisher,

00:01:26.829 --> 00:01:29.288
for Think Again for supporting
this episode.